<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13827] Deadlock when receiving ComputeTask result by IgniteClient.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13827</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Deadlock when receiving ComputeTask result by IgniteClient.&lt;br/&gt;
when ComputeTask return a user object for example:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;class &lt;/span&gt;TestVal(){
&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; val;
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;WA client.binary().toBinary(new TestVal());&lt;/p&gt;</description>
